发外袍持续向后飞扬。\n男主：亦要\n(6.6-7.4s) 快速下压特写，聚焦腰间银色雕花腰封与流苏，薄纱面料随风猛烈起伏，微光在刺绣纹路间明灭。\n(7.4-8.6s) 环绕慢推面部近景，冷峻侧脸，目光坚定一往无前，冷光勾勒下颌轮廓。\n男主：为苍生开辟\n(8.6-10.0s) 镜头向后拉远，完整背影定格，男子身后骤然爆发巨大金色光翼法阵，碎石四散激荡，宏大史诗光影，画面缓缓沉暗收束。\n男主尾音沉落：一线生机。", "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_text_encoder", "link": 9, "label": "h3_text_encoder", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TEXT_ENCODER", "localized_name": "h3_text_encoder"}, {"name": "h3_vae_bundle", "link": 10, "label": "h3_vae_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_VAE_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "h3_vae_bundle"}, {"name": "target", "link": 11, "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "references", "link": 31, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "ref_image_size"}, "shape": 7, "name": "ref_image_size", "label": "ref_image_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ref_image_size"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [448.2731628417969, 546.7102661132812], "pos": [835, 820.0000610351562], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode"}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-590.7922973632812, -532.1699829101562], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 25, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【wefjn44t】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff2929"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3066.3857421875, 210.6992645263672], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [51.35417175292969, -260